{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19591","headline":"春风扇微和 · 张汇","name":"春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木德生和气，微微入曙风。\n暗催南向叶，渐翥北归鸿。\n澹荡侵冰谷，悠扬转蕙丛。\n拂尘回广路，泛籁过遥空。\n暖上烟光际，云移律侯中。\n扶摇如可借，从此戾苍穹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张汇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}